{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "从数组两端放置左右指针，当前容量由较短边决定：面积 = 两指针距离 × 较短边高度。每轮只移动较短的一侧，因为保留短边并缩小宽度不可能得到更大面积。示例中最大面积由下标 1 和 8 构成，为 7 × 7 = 49。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>盛最多水的容器</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{height:auto;margin:0}body{background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:14px}.app{width:100%;min-height:auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding:clamp(14px,3vw,28px)}.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap}.title{font-size:clamp(18px,3vw,26px);font-weight:700;color:#fff}.sub{margin-top:5px;color:#9da1a6}.badge{padding:7px 12px;border:1px solid #3794ff;border-radius:18px;color:#3794ff}.board{position:relative;flex:1;min-height:320px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:12px;background:#252526;overflow:hidden;padding:24px 18px 52px}.chart{position:absolute;inset:24px 18px 52px;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:clamp(3px,1vw,12px);border-bottom:2px solid #777}.bar-wrap{height:100%;flex:1;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:center;position:relative;z-index:3}.bar{width:min(30px,72%);height:calc(var(--h)*10%);min-height:2px;background:#858585;border-radius:3px 3px 0 0;transition:background .45s,box-shadow .45s,transform .45s}.bar.endpoint{background:#3794ff;box-shadow:0 0 12px #3794ff88;transform:scaleX(1.12)}.value{position:absolute;bottom:calc(var(--h)*10% + 7px);font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#d4d4d4}.index{position:absolute;bottom:-28px;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#999}.water{position:absolute;z-index:2;background:rgba(14,99,156,.6);border-top:2px solid #3794ff;transition:left .55s,width .55s,height .55s,bottom .55s;pointer-events:none}.pointer{position:absolute;bottom:-48px;color:#3794ff;font-weight:700;transition:left .55s;transform:translateX(-50%);white-space:nowrap}.panel{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(110px,1fr));gap:10px}.card{background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:9px;padding:12px}.label{color:#9da1a6;margin-bottom:5px}.num{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:clamp(16px,2.5vw,22px);color:#fff}.best{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff}.explain{min-height:42px;padding:11px 14px;border-left:4px solid #3794ff;background:#252526;line-height:1.5}@media(max-width:620px){.panel{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.board{min-height:290px}}/* COMPACT */ html,body{font-size:12px!important;line-height:1.45!important}.app{padding:8px 10px 10px!important;max-width:560px!important;margin:0 auto!important;display:block!important;min-height:auto!important}.title{font-size:14px!important;color:#d4d4d4!important}.sub{font-size:12px!important;color:#8d8d8d!important}.badge{padding:2px 7px!important;border-radius:4px!important;font-size:10px!important}.board{min-height:160px!important;padding:8px 10px 28px!important;border-radius:6px!important}.chart{inset:8px 10px 24px!important}.bar{width:min(14px,70%)!important}.panel{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)!important;gap:6px!important}.card{padding:8px 10px!important;border-radius:6px!important}.label{font-size:10px!important;color:#8d8d8d!important;margin-bottom:2px!important}.num{font-size:13px!important}.explain{border-left-width:3px!important;padding:8px 10px!important;min-height:auto!important;font-size:12px!important}\n.board{min-height:190px!important}.chart{bottom:52px!important}.chart .index{bottom:-21px}.pointer{font-size:11px;z-index:4}</style></head><body><main class=\"app\"><header class=\"top\"><div><div class=\"title\">双指针寻找最大容器</div><div class=\"sub\">示例：[1, 8, 6, 2, 5, 4, 8, 3, 7]</div></div><div class=\"badge\">移动较短边</div></header><section class=\"board\"><div class=\"water\" id=\"water\"></div><div class=\"chart\" id=\"chart\"></div><div class=\"pointer\" id=\"lp\">左指针</div><div class=\"pointer\" id=\"rp\">右指针</div></section><section class=\"panel\"><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"label\">左右下标</div><div class=\"num\" id=\"pair\">0 ↔ 8</div></div><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"label\">宽度</div><div class=\"num\" id=\"width\">8</div></div><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"label\">当前面积</div><div class=\"num\" id=\"area\">8</div></div><div class=\"card best\"><div class=\"label\">历史最大值</div><div class=\"num\" id=\"best\">8</div></div></section><div class=\"explain\" id=\"explain\"></div></main><script>const h=[1,8,6,2,5,4,8,3,7],steps=[];let l=0,r=h.length-1,best=0;while(l<r){const area=(r-l)*Math.min(h[l],h[r]);best=Math.max(best,area);steps.push({l,r,area,best,move:h[l]<=h[r]?\"左\":\"右\"});if(h[l]<=h[r])l++;else r--}const chart=document.getElementById(\"chart\");h.forEach((v,i)=>{const w=document.createElement(\"div\");w.className=\"bar-wrap\";w.style.setProperty(\"--h\",v);w.innerHTML=`<span class=\"value\">${v}</span><div class=\"bar\" style=\"--h:${v}\"></div><span class=\"index\">${i}</span>`;chart.appendChild(w)});const bars=[...document.querySelectorAll(\".bar\")],water=document.getElementById(\"water\"),lp=document.getElementById(\"lp\"),rp=document.getElementById(\"rp\");function paintGeometry(s){const board=document.querySelector('.board'),br=board.getBoundingClientRect(),leftBar=bars[s.l].getBoundingClientRect(),rightBar=bars[s.r].getBoundingClientRect(),baseline=chart.getBoundingClientRect().bottom-board.clientTop-br.top;const left=(leftBar.left+leftBar.right)/2-board.clientLeft-br.left,right=(rightBar.left+rightBar.right)/2-board.clientLeft-br.left;water.style.left=left+'px';water.style.width=Math.max(0,right-left)+'px';water.style.height=Math.min(leftBar.height,rightBar.height)+'px';water.style.top=(baseline-Math.min(leftBar.height,rightBar.height))+'px';water.style.bottom='auto';lp.style.left=left+'px';rp.style.left=right+'px';lp.style.top=rp.style.top=(baseline+24)+'px';lp.style.bottom=rp.style.bottom='auto';lp.textContent='L = '+s.l;rp.textContent='R = '+s.r;}\nlet k=0;function render(){const s=steps[k],n=h.length,gap=100/(n-1),level=Math.min(h[s.l],h[s.r]);bars.forEach((b,i)=>b.classList.toggle(\"endpoint\",i===s.l||i===s.r));paintGeometry(s);document.getElementById(\"pair\").textContent=`${s.l} ↔ ${s.r}`;document.getElementById(\"width\").textContent=s.r-s.l;document.getElementById(\"area\").textContent=`${s.r-s.l} × ${level} = ${s.area}`;document.getElementById(\"best\").textContent=s.best;document.getElementById(\"explain\").textContent=s.area===49?\"找到最优容器：宽度 7，受较短的右边界高度 7 限制，面积为 49。\":`当前较短边在${s.move}侧；记录面积后移动${s.move}指针，尝试寻找更高的边界。`;k=(k+1)%steps.length}render();window.addEventListener(\"resize\",()=>paintGeometry(steps[(k+steps.length-1)%steps.length]));setInterval(render,1500);</script></body></html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": ""
}
